{"id":"09adf240622edece","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-thm-ccc-criteria.md","title":"CCC Criterion","display":"thm-ccc-criteria — CCC Criterion","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-ccc-criteria","aliases":["58-thm-ccc-criteria"],"display":"thm-ccc-criteria — CCC Criterion","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-ccc.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-antichain.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-ccc-criteria"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-ccc-criteria</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ccc-criteria — CCC Criterion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"937fc0dd4cc72948\" href=\"?note=937fc0dd4cc72948\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ccc.md\">../batch10/58-df-ccc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b98049bc73009c64\" href=\"?note=b98049bc73009c64\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-antichain.md\">../batch11/58-df-antichain.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,A,{\\le_P}\\in V\">\\(P,A,{\\le_P}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,{\\le_P})\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,{\\le_P})\\)</span>（偏序集谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CCC}(P,{\\le_P})\">\\(\\mathrm{CCC}(P,{\\le_P})\\)</span>（可数链条件谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"937fc0dd4cc72948\" href=\"?note=937fc0dd4cc72948\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ccc.md\">../batch10/58-df-ccc.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,{\\le_P})\">\\(\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,{\\le_P})\\)</span>（反链谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b98049bc73009c64\" href=\"?note=b98049bc73009c64\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-antichain.md\">../batch11/58-df-antichain.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S\\)</span>（可数集谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ccc\\text{-}criteria}\\vdash \\mathrm{Poset}(P,{\\le_P})\\to\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CCC}(P,{\\le_P})\\leftrightarrow\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,{\\le_P})\\to\\mathrm{Countable}_S(A)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ccc\\text{-}criteria}\\vdash \\mathrm{Poset}(P,{\\le_P})\\to\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CCC}(P,{\\le_P})\\leftrightarrow\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,{\\le_P})\\to\\mathrm{Countable}_S(A)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>ccc 的精确含义是不存在不可数反链。</li>\n<li>当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 是强迫偏序时，ccc 强迫保持基数与共尾数；这一保持结论需要强迫语境。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-ccc.md","status":"resolved","id":"937fc0dd4cc72948","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-ccc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-antichain.md","status":"resolved","id":"b98049bc73009c64","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-antichain.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}(P,{\\le_P})$（偏序集谓词，见 [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-ccc.md","status":"resolved","id":"937fc0dd4cc72948","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CCC}(P,{\\le_P})$（可数链条件谓词，见 [[../batch10/58-df-ccc.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-antichain.md","status":"resolved","id":"b98049bc73009c64","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,P,{\\le_P})$（反链谓词，见 [[../batch11/58-df-antichain.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Countable}_S$（可数集谓词，见 [[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]）","embed":false}]